  "section": "3.21",
  "rulesText": "This section presents the Ranger spell list. The spells are organized by spell level and then alphabetized, and each spell's school of magic is listed. In the Special column, C means the spell requires Concentration, R means it's a Ritual, and M means it requires a specific Material component.\n\nLevel 1 Ranger Spells\n\nLevel 2 Ranger Spells\n\nLevel 3 Ranger Spells\n\nLevel 4 Ranger Spells\n\nLevel 5 Ranger Spells",
